{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b9ae62c6-e18e-8bf6-b5f4-b4dacf630720",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T14:29:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:27:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, madam. Thank you for taking my call. My name is Walter Gardiner. I am calling about water that stays in front of my garage, from the storm drain, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:27:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Gardiner. Can I get the address where this is happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:27:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is 155 Coggeshall Avenue, in the Historic Hill area. I am renting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:27:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "155 Coggeshall Avenue. Got it. And tell me what you're seeing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:01-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, the apron of the driveway holds a big puddle. And the water, it goes down toward the garage door. It is still there today, two days after. Excuse me, one moment, my screen is too bright and I am squinting at it, I am trying to see my photos."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. So the puddle sits at the bottom of the driveway and runs toward the garage door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:27-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly, yes. And I must say, it was not this bad last winter. Last year we had snow and rain also, but the water went away. Now it does not go. I am a little tired of this, to be honest, because I have told myself it will dry, and it does not dry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Is the water getting inside the garage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Almost, madam. It reaches the door, under the edge. Not inside very much yet, but it is close. [pause] Please, may I ask, is this a city drain or a state one? Nobody has told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:29:01-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair question. On a lot of streets it's the city's, but some roads belong to the state, and I can't tell from here which this is. I'll send this to our crew supervisor and they can check the drain in front of 155 Coggeshall and who is responsible for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:29:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I hope someone can come soon, because the crews, they are surely busy after the storm, but the water is still there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:29:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They are busy, yes, but I'll note that it's still standing two days later and heading toward your garage. Can I confirm your number? Is it 401-555-0198?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:29:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Four zero one, five five five, zero one nine eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:29:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I have 155 Coggeshall Avenue, standing water at the driveway apron, drain ownership question, and your cell number. Someone should call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:29:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, madam. You are very kind. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Gardiner. Bye now."
    }
  ],
